const names={image:'图像工作台',video:'视频工作台',audio:'音频工作台',assistant:'网页 AI 助手',usage:'模型与用量',history:'作品库',materials:'素材库',settings:'模型接入'};
const kindNames={image:'图像',video:'视频',chat:'文本',audio:'音频'};
const protocolNames={minimax_image:'MiniMax 图像',openai_speech:'OpenAI Speech',minimax_speech:'MiniMax 语音',openai_image:'OpenAI Images',openai_video:'OpenAI Videos',openai_chat:'Chat Completions',openai_responses:'OpenAI Responses',anthropic:'Anthropic Messages',gemini:'Google Gemini',custom:'自定义 JSON'};
const protocolOptions={image:['openai_image','minimax_image','gemini','custom'],audio:['openai_speech','minimax_speech','custom'],video:['openai_video','custom'],chat:['openai_chat','openai_responses','anthropic','gemini','custom']};
const capabilityNames={reference_images:'参考图',first_frame:'首帧',last_frame:'尾帧',negative_prompt:'负面提示词',seed:'随机种子',aspect_ratio:'画幅比例',quality:'画质',batch:'批量生成',background:'透明背景',resolution:'分辨率',camera:'运镜',motion:'运动幅度',strength:'参考强度',audio:'生成音频',voice:'音色',speed:'语速'};
const statusNames={queued:'本机排队',submitting:'正在提交',polling:'生成中',succeeded:'已完成',failed:'失败',interrupted:'已中断'};
const makeDraft=()=>({prompt:'',mode:'text',size:'auto',seconds:4,parameters:{},assets:{references:[],first_frame:null,last_frame:null}});
const state={page:'image',providers:[],jobs:[],conversations:[],csrf:'',selected:{},drafts:{image:makeDraft(),video:makeDraft(),audio:makeDraft()},assets:{},currentJob:{},assetIndex:{},conversationId:null,assistantDraft:'',assistantContext:null,attachContext:false,assistantOrigin:'image',busy:false,uploading:0,period:'7d',usage:null,usageLoading:false,usageError:'',filter:'all',detail:null};
const active=j=>['queued','submitting','polling'].includes(j.status);
const count=n=>n==null?'—':Number(n).toLocaleString('zh-CN');
const timeLabel=t=>t?new Date(t).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{month:'2-digit',day:'2-digit',hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'}):'—';
const elapsed=ms=>ms==null?'—':ms<1000?`${ms} ms`:ms<60000?`${(ms/1000).toFixed(1)} 秒`:`${(ms/60000).toFixed(1)} 分钟`;
const badge=j=>`<span class="status-badge ${esc(j.status)}">${active(j)?'<span class="spinner"></span>':''}${esc(statusNames[j.status]||j.status)}</span>`;
let toastTimer,polling=false,lastResultSignature='',assistantSignature='',usageVersion=0,conversationVersion=0;
const uploadLocks=new Set();
function toast(text){$('#toast').textContent=text;$('#toast').classList.add('visible');clearTimeout(toastTimer);toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>$('#toast').classList.remove('visible'),5200)}
async function api(path,body){const r=await fetch(path,body===undefined?{}:{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json','X-CSRF-Token':state.csrf},body:JSON.stringify(body)});let data;try{data=await r.json()}catch{throw Error('无法读取本机服务，请确认光屿 AI 正在运行。')}if(!r.ok)throw Error(data.error||`请求失败（${r.status}）`);return data}
function providerUsable(p){const kinds=p.model_constraints?.kinds||[];return !kinds.length||kinds.includes(p.kind)}
function chosen(kind){return state.providers.find(p=>p.id===state.selected[kind]&&p.kind===kind&&providerUsable(p))||state.providers.find(p=>p.kind===kind&&providerUsable(p))}
function options(kind){const list=state.providers.filter(p=>p.kind===kind&&providerUsable(p));return list.length?list.map(p=>`<option value="${p.id}" ${chosen(kind)?.id===p.id?'selected':''}>${esc(p.name)} · ${esc(p.model)}</option>`).join(''):`<option value="">选择${kind==='chat'?'语言模型':kindNames[kind]+'模型'} · 请先接入</option>`}
function capabilities(p){return p?.capabilities||{}}
function capChips(p,limit=5){return Object.entries(capabilities(p)).filter(([,v])=>v).slice(0,limit).map(([k])=>`<span class="cap-chip enabled">${capabilityNames[k]}</span>`).join('')}
function heading(title,description,actions='',which=state.page){return `<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="heading-title">${icon(which)}<h1>${title}</h1></div><p>${description}</p></div><div class="heading-actions">${actions}</div></div>`}
function empty(which,title,description,action=''){return `<div class="empty-state">${icon(which)}<h3>${title}</h3><p>${description}</p>${action}</div>`}
function renderNavigation(){$('#main-nav').innerHTML=Object.entries(names).map(([key,name],i)=>`${i===4?'<div class="nav-divider"></div>':''}<button data-page="${key}" title="${name}" aria-label="${name}" class="${state.page===key?'active':''}">${icon(key)}<span>${name}</span></button>`).join('');$('#connection-count').textContent=`${state.providers.length} 个模型已接入`;$('#breadcrumb').textContent=names[state.page];$('#assistant-fab').innerHTML=icon('assistant')+'<span>网页 AI 助手</span>';$('#assistant-fab').hidden=state.page==='assistant'||$('#assistant-dialog').open}
function go(page){state.detail=null;closeAssistant();if(location.hash==='#'+page)render();else location.hash=page}
function render(){let hash=location.hash.slice(1);if(hash==='chat')hash='assistant';state.page=names[hash]?hash:'image';renderNavigation();lastResultSignature='';if(['image','video'].includes(state.page))renderStudio(state.page);else if(state.page==='audio')renderAudio();else if(state.page==='assistant')renderAssistantPage();else if(state.page==='usage'){renderUsage();refreshUsage()}else if(state.page==='history')renderHistory();else if(state.page==='materials')renderMaterials();else renderSettings()}

const materialCatalog=[{
  id:'oimi-heavenly-palace',
  title:'中式天宫仙境 · 场景参考',
  source:'Oimi AI Studio',
  sourceTitle:'Midjourney x 中式天宫仙境 10 大热门案例',
  url:'https://oimi.ai/zh/templates/10-trending-midjourney-chinese-heavenly-palace',
  cover:'https://static.oimi.ai/template/image/cmsn11git006spe01qsqfw6x4-2026-08-10_09-45-42-846-0.png?display=1',
  description:'围绕云海、宫阙与古松的国风场景参考，适合寻找玄幻环境、建筑构图和电影光影灵感。原站提供案例图片与提示词。',
  tags:['中式美学','玄幻建筑','Midjourney'],
  category:'图像灵感'
}];
const materialView={query:''};
function renderMaterials(){
  $('#page').innerHTML=heading('素材库','收集创作参考，随时打开来源查看案例图片与提示词。')+
    `<section class="materials-toolbar" aria-label="素材搜索"><label class="material-search">${icon('search')}<span class="sr-only">搜索素材</span><input id="material-search" type="search" placeholder="搜索主题、标签或来源" value="${esc(materialView.query)}"></label><span class="micro" id="material-count"></span></section><div id="material-results" class="material-grid"></div><p class="materials-footnote">${icon('info')} 这里收藏素材来源；封面来自原站，完整图片、提示词和工作流请在来源页面查看。</p>`;
  $('#material-search').oninput=e=>{materialView.query=e.target.value;drawMaterialCards()};
  drawMaterialCards();
}
function drawMaterialCards(){
  const query=materialView.query.trim().toLowerCase();
  const items=materialCatalog.filter(item=>[item.title,item.source,item.sourceTitle,item.description,...item.tags].join(' ').toLowerCase().includes(query));
  $('#material-count').textContent=`${items.length} / ${materialCatalog.length} 项素材`;
  $('#material-results').innerHTML=items.length?items.map(item=>`<article class="panel material-card"><a class="material-cover" href="${esc(item.url)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="打开 ${esc(item.title)} 的来源页面"><div class="material-cover-fallback">${icon('materials')}<span>中式天宫 · 创作参考</span></div><img src="${esc(item.cover)}" alt="Oimi 中式天宫场景案例封面" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><span class="material-cover-label">${esc(item.category)}</span></a><div class="material-card-body"><div class="material-source"><span>${esc(item.source)}</span><span>参考专题</span></div><h2>${esc(item.title)}</h2><p class="material-description">${esc(item.description)}</p><div class="material-tags">${item.tags.map(tag=>`<span>${esc(tag)}</span>`).join('')}</div><div class="material-attribution"><span>原站标题</span><p>${esc(item.sourceTitle)}</p></div><div class="material-actions"><a class="button primary" href="${esc(item.url)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看素材与提示词 ${icon('arrow')}</a><button class="button secondary" data-copy-material="${esc(item.id)}">${icon('copy')} 复制链接</button></div></div></article>`).join(''):`<section class="panel material-empty">${empty('search','没有找到相关素材','试试“天宫”“玄幻”或“Midjourney”。')}<button class="button secondary" id="material-clear-search">清空搜索</button></section>`;
  $('#material-results').querySelectorAll('.material-cover img').forEach(img=>img.addEventListener('error',()=>{img.hidden=true},{once:true}));
  const clear=$('#material-clear-search');if(clear)clear.onclick=()=>{materialView.query='';$('#material-search').value='';drawMaterialCards();$('#material-search').focus()};
}
function modeTabs(kind,p,d){const c=capabilities(p);const modes=kind==='image'?[['text','文生图',true],['reference','参考图创作',c.reference_images]]:[['text','文生视频',true],['first','首帧引导',c.first_frame],['first_last','首尾帧',c.first_frame&&c.last_frame]];return `<div class="mode-tabs" role="group" aria-label="创作模式">${modes.map(([v,label,support])=>`<button type="button" data-mode="${v}" class="${d.mode===v?'active':''}" ${support?'':'disabled'} title="${support?label:'当前接口未配置该能力'}">${label}</button>`).join('')}</div>`}
function section(label,number,content,action=''){return `<section class="form-section"><div class="section-label"><span><span class="number">${number}</span>${label}</span>${action}</div>${content}</section>`}
function uploadSlot(kind,slot,index=null,enabled=false){const d=state.drafts[kind];const id=slot==='references'?d.assets.references[index]:d.assets[slot];const a=state.assets[id];const inputId=`upload-${kind}-${slot}-${index??'frame'}`;return `<div class="upload-slot ${enabled?'':'locked'}" data-drop-slot="${slot}" data-kind="${kind}">${a?`<img class="upload-preview" src="${esc(a.url)}" alt="${esc(a.name)}" data-preview-upload="${a.id}"><span class="asset-name">${a.width} × ${a.height}</span><button type="button" class="remove-asset" data-remove-asset="${slot}" data-index="${index??''}" aria-label="移除${slot==='first_frame'?'首帧':slot==='last_frame'?'尾帧':'参考图'}">${icon('close')}</button>`:`<label class="upload-trigger" for="${inputId}">${icon(enabled?'plus':'lock')}<span>${enabled?'上传图片':'接口未支持'}</span><small>${enabled?'点击或拖入':'在设置中配置能力'}</small></label><input class="sr-only" id="${inputId}" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" data-upload-slot="${slot}" data-kind="${kind}" ${slot==='references'?'multiple':''} ${enabled?'':'disabled'}>`}</div>`}
function assetsPanel(kind,p,d){const c=capabilities(p);if(kind==='image'){return `<div class="reference-grid">${d.assets.references.map((_,i)=>uploadSlot(kind,'references',i,c.reference_images)).join('')}${d.assets.references.length<8?uploadSlot(kind,'references',d.assets.references.length,c.reference_images):''}</div><p class="field-hint">PNG / JPG / WebP · 每张最多 10 MiB · 最多 8 张。${d.mode==='text'&&d.assets.references.length?'已保留参考图；切换参考图模式后才会发送。':''}</p>`}return `<div class="upload-grid"><div><div class="frame-label"><b>A</b> 首帧${d.mode==='text'?' · 可选':''}</div>${uploadSlot(kind,'first_frame',null,c.first_frame)}</div><div><div class="frame-label"><b>B</b> 尾帧${d.mode!=='first_last'?' · 可选':''}</div>${uploadSlot(kind,'last_frame',null,c.last_frame)}</div></div><div class="flow-caption">起始画面 ───── 镜头过渡 ───── 结束画面</div><p class="field-hint">${p?.protocol==='openai_video'?'此协议支持首帧，图片尺寸需与视频一致；尾帧需使用支持该能力的接口。':'首尾帧仅在对应模式下发送。图片保存在本机，生成时交给所选模型。'}</p>`}
function advancedControl(label,key,kind,c,{type='text',choices=null,placeholder='使用模型默认值',min,max,step}={}){const d=state.drafts[kind],flag=key==='n'?'batch':key,enabled=Boolean(c[flag]);let control;if(choices)control=`<select data-param="${key}" ${enabled?'':'disabled'}><option value="">模型默认</option>${choices.map(([v,l])=>`<option value="${v}" ${String(d.parameters[key])===String(v)?'selected':''}>${l}</option>`).join('')}</select>`;else if(type==='textarea')control=`<textarea rows="2" data-param="${key}" maxlength="4000" placeholder="${placeholder}" ${enabled?'':'disabled'}>${esc(d.parameters[key]||'')}</textarea>`;else control=`<input type="${type}" data-param="${key}" value="${esc(d.parameters[key]??'')}" placeholder="${placeholder}" ${min!==undefined?`min="${min}"`:''} ${max!==undefined?`max="${max}"`:''} ${step!==undefined?`step="${step}"`:''} ${enabled?'':'disabled'}>`;return `<label><span class="control-head">${label}${enabled?'':`<span class="locked-label">${icon('lock')} 未配置</span>`}</span>${control}</label>`}
function qualityOptions(p){return p?.model?.toLowerCase()==='dall-e-3'?[['standard','标准'],['hd','高清']]:[['low','快速'],['medium','均衡'],['high','精细']]}
function normalizeQuality(kind,p){const value=state.drafts[kind].parameters.quality;if(value!=null&&value!==''&&!qualityOptions(p).some(([v])=>v===value))delete state.drafts[kind].parameters.quality}
function advancedFields(kind,p){normalizeQuality(kind,p);const c=capabilities(p),quality=qualityOptions(p);return `<details class="advanced"><summary><span>${icon('sliders')} 高级控制</span>${icon('down')}</summary><div class="advanced-body">${advancedControl('负面提示词','negative_prompt',kind,c,{type:'textarea',placeholder:'不希望出现的元素，例如模糊、文字、水印'})}<div class="field-grid">${advancedControl('随机种子','seed',kind,c,{type:'number',min:0,max:2147483647,placeholder:'随机'})}${kind==='image'?advancedControl('生成数量','n',kind,c,{choices:[[1,'1 张'],[2,'2 张'],[4,'4 张']]}):advancedControl('运动幅度','motion',kind,c,{choices:[['low','轻微'],['medium','适中'],['high','明显']]})}</div><div class="field-grid">${kind==='image'?advancedControl('生成质量','quality',kind,c,{choices:quality}):advancedControl('镜头运动','camera',kind,c,{choices:[['static','固定镜头'],['push_in','缓慢推进'],['pull_out','缓慢拉远'],['orbit','环绕镜头'],['pan','水平平移']]})}${advancedControl('输出分辨率','resolution',kind,c,{choices:[['1K','1K'],['2K','2K'],['4K','4K']]})}</div><div class="field-grid">${advancedControl('画幅比例','aspect_ratio',kind,c,{choices:[['1:1','1:1'],['16:9','16:9'],['9:16','9:16'],['4:3','4:3'],['3:4','3:4']]})}${kind==='image'?advancedControl('背景','background',kind,c,{choices:[['opaque','不透明'],['transparent','透明']]}):advancedControl('声音','audio',kind,c,{choices:[['true','生成声音'],['false','静音']]})}</div>${advancedControl('参考强度（0–1）','strength',kind,c,{type:'number',min:0,max:1,step:.05,placeholder:'模型默认'})}<p class="field-hint">可用参数由协议与模型配置决定。自定义接口的选项名称与取值需按平台文档调整；未启用的参数不会发送。</p></div></details>`}
function renderStudio(kind){const d=state.drafts[kind],p=chosen(kind),video=kind==='video';if(p)state.selected[kind]=p.id;const caps=capabilities(p);if((d.mode==='reference'&&!caps.reference_images)||(d.mode==='first'&&!caps.first_frame)||(d.mode==='first_last'&&(!caps.first_frame||!caps.last_frame)))d.mode='text';const sizeEnabled=!!p&&!['gemini','minimax_image'].includes(p.protocol)&&(p.protocol!=='custom'||p.mapped_controls?.size===true),secondsEnabled=!!p&&(p.protocol!=='custom'||p.mapped_controls?.seconds===true);if(!sizeEnabled)d.size='auto';if(!secondsEnabled)d.seconds=4;const presets=video?[['auto','默认','auto'],['1280x720','16:9',''],['720x1280','9:16','portrait'],['1792x1024','宽屏','']]:[['auto','默认','auto'],['1024x1024','1:1','square'],['1536x1024','3:2',''],['1024x1536','2:3','portrait']];
$('#page').innerHTML=heading(names[kind],video?'从文字到镜头，以首尾帧控制画面叙事。':'在同一个画布中，完成构思、参考与精细生成。',`<button class="button secondary" data-page="history">${icon('history')} 作品库</button>`)+`<div class="studio"><section class="panel inspector"><div class="inspector-title"><h2>创作设置</h2><span class="step-label">${video?'VIDEO':'IMAGE'} STUDIO</span></div><form id="generation-form"><div class="inspector-scroll">${section('模型与模式','01',modeTabs(kind,p,d)+`<label class="sr-only" for="model-select">创作模型</label><div class="model-field"><select id="model-select">${options(kind)}</select></div><div class="model-caption"><span>${p?esc(protocolNames[p.protocol]):'接入你自己的 API 即可开始'}</span><button type="button" class="text-button" data-action="add-provider">${icon('plus')} ${p?'添加':'接入模型'}</button></div>${p?`<div class="cap-chips">${capChips(p)||'<span class="cap-chip">文字生成</span>'}</div>`:''}`)}${section(video?'镜头描述':'画面描述','02',`<label class="sr-only" for="prompt">${video?'镜头描述':'画面描述'}</label><textarea id="prompt" class="prompt-area" maxlength="32000" required placeholder="${video?'描述场景、人物动作、镜头运动与光影氛围…':'描述主体、场景、构图与光线，让画面更接近你的想象…'}">${esc(d.prompt)}</textarea><div class="prompt-foot"><span id="prompt-count">${d.prompt.length} / 32000</span><span>细节越清晰，表达越准确</span></div><div class="preset-chips">${(video?['电影感镜头','产品环绕','自然风景']:['产品摄影','空间设计','电影质感']).map((x,i)=>`<button type="button" data-preset="${i}">${x}</button>`).join('')}</div>`,`<button type="button" class="text-button" data-action="polish">${icon('assistant')} 助手润色</button>`)}${section(video?'首尾帧素材':'参考素材','03',assetsPanel(kind,p,d))}${section('画面参数','04',`<div class="ratio-options">${presets.map(([v,l,shape])=>`<button type="button" class="ratio-option ${d.size===v?'active':''}" data-size="${v}" ${sizeEnabled?'':'disabled'}><span class="ratio-shape ${shape}"></span>${l}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="field-grid dimension-fields"><label>请求尺寸<input id="size-input" value="${esc(d.size)}" placeholder="auto 或 宽x高" ${sizeEnabled?'':'disabled'}></label>${video?`<label>${secondsEnabled?'视频时长（秒）':'时长由平台决定'}<input type="number" min="1" max="120" id="seconds-input" value="${secondsEnabled?d.seconds:''}" placeholder="模型默认" ${secondsEnabled?'':'disabled'}></label>`:`<label>生成方式<input value="${d.mode==='reference'?'参考图创作':'文字生成'}" disabled></label>`}</div><p class="field-hint">${['gemini','minimax_image'].includes(p?.protocol)?'此协议使用高级控制中的画幅比例与分辨率，像素尺寸由模型决定。':p?.protocol==='custom'&&!sizeEnabled?'请求模板未映射尺寸，使用平台默认设置。':'尺寸与'+(video?'时长':'比例')+'以模型支持为准。auto 使用接口默认值。'}</p>`)}${advancedFields(kind,p)}</div><div class="generate-footer"><button type="submit" id="generate-button" class="button primary wide" ${!p||state.busy||state.uploading?'disabled':''}>${icon(video?'video':'spark')} ${state.uploading?'素材上传中…':video?'生成视频':'生成图像'}</button><div class="generate-note"><span>${p?esc(p.model):'尚未选择模型'}</span><span>${icon('lock')} 本机存储</span></div></div></form></section><div class="canvas-column"><section class="canvas-panel"><div class="canvas-toolbar"><h2>${icon('grid')} 创作画布</h2><div class="canvas-tools"><small>${video?'VIDEO PREVIEW':'IMAGE PREVIEW'}</small><button class="icon-button" title="放大预览" aria-label="放大预览" data-action="expand-result">${icon('expand')}</button></div></div><div id="result-content"></div></section><section class="panel timeline-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>最近创作</h2><button class="text-button" data-page="history">查看全部 ${icon('arrow')}</button></div><div id="recent-content"></div></section><section class="assistant-inline">${icon('assistant')}<div><h3>让网页 AI 助手帮你完善创意</h3><p>润色提示词、拆解镜头，或解释生成参数。</p></div><button class="text-button" data-action="open-assistant">开始对话 ${icon('arrow')}</button></section></div></div>`;
$('#model-select').onchange=e=>{state.selected[kind]=e.target.value;renderStudio(kind);lastResultSignature='';updateResult()};$('#prompt').oninput=e=>{d.prompt=e.target.value;$('#prompt-count').textContent=`${d.prompt.length} / 32000`};$('#size-input').oninput=e=>{d.size=e.target.value;document.querySelectorAll('[data-size]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.size===d.size))};if(video)$('#seconds-input').oninput=e=>d.seconds=Number(e.target.value);$('#generation-form').onsubmit=submitGeneration;document.querySelectorAll('[data-param]').forEach(input=>input.oninput=e=>{const k=input.dataset.param;let v=e.target.value;if(v!==''&&['seed','n','strength'].includes(k))v=Number(v);if(k==='audio'&&v!=='')v=v==='true';d.parameters[k]=v});document.querySelectorAll('[data-upload-slot]').forEach(input=>input.onchange=()=>uploadFiles([...input.files],kind,input.dataset.uploadSlot));document.querySelectorAll('[data-drop-slot]').forEach(el=>{el.ondragover=e=>e.preventDefault();el.ondrop=e=>{e.preventDefault();const flag=el.dataset.dropSlot==='references'?'reference_images':el.dataset.dropSlot;if(!caps[flag])return toast('当前连接尚未配置此素材能力');uploadFiles([...e.dataTransfer.files],kind,el.dataset.dropSlot)}});updateResult(true);renderRecent();}
function stageEmpty(kind,title,description,loading=false){return `<div class="stage"><span class="stage-tag">${icon('frame')} ${kind==='audio'?'AUDIO STUDIO':kind==='video'?'MOTION CANVAS':'IMAGE CANVAS'}</span>${['tl','tr','bl','br'].map(x=>`<span class="stage-corner ${x}"></span>`).join('')}<div class="canvas-empty"><div class="canvas-empty-icon">${icon(kind)}</div><h3>${title}</h3><p>${description}</p>${loading?'<div class="progress-line"></div>':'<small>YOUR NEXT CREATION STARTS HERE</small>'}</div></div>`}
function currentJob(kind){return state.jobs.find(j=>j.id===state.currentJob[kind])||state.jobs.find(j=>j.kind===kind)}
function currentAsset(job){return job?.result?.assets?.[state.assetIndex[job.id]||0]}
function archiveLabel(job){if(!job.result?.assets?.length)return '';const status=job.archive_status||'pending';return `<span class="archive-label ${esc(status)}">${status==='saved'?'已保存到本机':status==='pending'?'正在保存作品':status==='partial'?'部分作品未保存':'作品未保存'}</span>`}
function archiveNotice(job){if(!job.result?.assets?.length)return '';const a=currentAsset(job);if(job.archive_status==='saved')return '<div class="archive-notice saved">'+icon('check')+'<span>已保存到作品库 · 刷新、重启后仍可查看</span></div>';if(job.archive_status==='pending')return '<div class="archive-notice"><span class="spinner"></span><span>生成已完成，正在保存原文件到本机作品库…</span></div>';return `<div class="archive-notice failed"><div><strong>${a?.local?'当前作品已保存，其他作品尚未保存':'生成已完成，原文件尚未保存'}</strong><p>${esc(a?.save_error||'原平台链接已保留，可以重试保存。')}</p></div><button class="button secondary" data-archive="${job.id}">${icon('download')} 重试保存</button></div>`}
function libraryWorks(){return state.jobs.filter(j=>j.status==='succeeded'&&['image','video','audio'].includes(j.kind)&&j.result?.assets?.length)}
function librarySummary(){const media=libraryWorks();const assets=media.flatMap(j=>j.result.assets);const saved=assets.filter(a=>a.local).length;const pending=media.filter(j=>j.archive_status==='pending').length;return `<div class="library-summary"><div>${icon('grid')}<span><strong>${saved}</strong> 件已保存作品</span></div><div>${icon('clock')}<span><strong>${pending}</strong> 个任务正在保存</span></div><div>${icon('info')}<span><strong>${assets.length-saved}</strong> 件尚未保存</span></div></div><p class="library-location">${icon('lock')} 作品文件保存在这台电脑的工作区 data/media，网页提供查看与下载入口。备份或迁移时请保留完整 data 文件夹。</p>`}
function resultHTML(job,kind=job?.kind){if(!job)return stageEmpty(kind,kind==='audio'?'让文字，拥有声音':kind==='video'?'让画面开始流动':'你的下一个作品，从这里开始','选择模型并描述你的灵感。<br>生成后自动保存到作品库，可随时查看和下载。')+'<div class="canvas-info"><span>等待创作</span><span>真实生成 · 本机记录</span></div>';const a=currentAsset(job);const u=job.usage||job.result?.usage;let inner=active(job)?stageEmpty(kind,statusNames[job.status],`${job.upstream_status==='retrying'?'平台连接暂时不稳定，正在重试查询。':'你可以切换页面，任务会在后台继续。'}${Number.isFinite(job.progress)?'<br>平台进度 '+esc(job.progress)+'%':''}`,true):job.status==='succeeded'&&a&&(!a.save_error||a.local)?`<div class="stage result">${a.type==='audio'?`<div class="audio-result">${icon('audio')}<strong>AI 生成语音</strong><audio src="${esc(a.url)}" controls preload="metadata"></audio></div>`:a.type==='video'?`<video src="${esc(a.url)}" controls playsinline preload="metadata"></video>`:`<img src="${esc(a.url)}" alt="${esc(job.prompt.slice(0,100))}" data-expand-job="${job.id}">`}</div>`:stageEmpty(kind,job.status==='succeeded'?'作品暂时无法预览':'这次创作尚未完成',job.status==='succeeded'?'平台已完成生成，但原文件尚未保存到本机。':'查看下方原因，调整参数或继续查询原任务。');
inner+=archiveNotice(job);
if(job.error)inner+=`<div class="notice error result-notice">${esc(job.error)}${job.upstream_id?`<br><small>平台任务：${esc(job.upstream_id)}</small><br><button class="button secondary" data-resume="${job.id}">${icon('refresh')} 继续查询原任务</button>`:''}</div>`;
inner+=`<div class="canvas-info"><span>${badge(job)}</span><span>${a?`<a class="text-button" href="${esc(a.url+(a.local?'?download=1':''))}" ${a.local?'download':'target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"'}>${icon('download')} ${a.local?'下载作品':'打开 / 另存'}</a>`:timeLabel(job.created_at)}</span></div>`;
if((job.result?.assets?.length||0)>1)inner+=`<div class="multi-assets">${job.result.assets.map((x,i)=>`<button class="${i===(state.assetIndex[job.id]||0)?'active':''}" data-asset-index="${i}" data-job="${job.id}" aria-label="查看第 ${i+1} 个结果">${x.type==='image'?`<img src="${esc(x.url)}" alt="作品 ${i+1}">`:icon('video')}</button>`).join('')}</div>`;
inner+=`<div class="canvas-meta"><div><small>生成模型</small><span title="${esc(job.response_model||job.model)}">${esc(job.response_model||job.model)}</span></div><div><small>${kind==='audio'?'音色':kind==='video'?'请求时长':'请求尺寸'}</small><span>${kind==='audio'?esc(job.parameters?.voice||'模型默认'):kind==='video'?(job.mapped_controls_snapshot?.seconds===false?'平台默认':job.seconds+' 秒（请求值）'):esc(job.size==='auto'?'模型默认':job.size)}</span></div><div><small>本次 Token</small><span>${count(u?.total_tokens)}${u?.total_tokens==null?' · 未提供':''}</span></div><div><small>耗时</small><span>${elapsed(job.elapsed_ms)}</span></div></div>`;return inner}
function updateResult(force=false){const root=$('#result-content');if(!root)return;const j=currentJob(state.page),signature=JSON.stringify([j,state.assetIndex[j?.id]]);if(!force&&signature===lastResultSignature)return;lastResultSignature=signature;root.innerHTML=resultHTML(j,state.page);root.querySelectorAll('img,video,audio').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('error',()=>toast('媒体预览加载失败，可尝试打开原始链接。'),{once:true}));renderRecent()}
function renderRecent(){const root=$('#recent-content');if(!root)return;const jobs=state.jobs.filter(j=>j.kind===state.page).slice(0,4);root.innerHTML=jobs.length?`<div class="recent-grid">${jobs.map(j=>{const a=j.result?.assets?.[0];return `<button class="recent-item ${j.id===currentJob(state.page)?.id?'selected':''}" data-select-job="${j.id}"><div class="recent-thumb">${a?.type==='image'?`<img src="${esc(a.url)}" alt="${esc(j.prompt.slice(0,40))}" loading="lazy">`:icon(j.kind)}</div><span>${esc(j.prompt)}</span></button>`}).join('')}</div>`:'<div class="empty-line">这里将收纳你的最近作品</div>'}
async function uploadFiles(files,kind,slot){
 const lock=kind+':'+slot;if(uploadLocks.has(lock))return toast('这一组素材正在上传，请等待完成后再添加');
 const d=state.drafts[kind],max=slot==='references'?Math.max(0,8-d.assets.references.length):1;
 if(!max)return toast('最多上传 8 张参考图');const list=files.slice(0,max);if(!list.length)return;
 uploadLocks.add(lock);state.uploading+=list.length;updateGenerate();
 try{
  for(const file of list){
   if(slot==='references'&&d.assets.references.length>=8)throw Error('最多上传 8 张参考图');
   if(!['image/png','image/jpeg','image/webp'].includes(file.type))throw Error('仅支持 PNG、JPEG、WebP 图片');
   if(file.size>10*1024*1024)throw Error('单张图片不能超过 10 MiB');
   const raw=await new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{const reader=new FileReader();reader.onload=()=>resolve(String(reader.result).split(',')[1]);reader.onerror=()=>reject(Error('无法读取这张图片'));reader.readAsDataURL(file)});
   const a=await api('/api/uploads',{name:file.name,data_base64:raw});state.assets[a.id]=a;
   if(slot==='references'){if(d.assets.references.length>=8)throw Error('最多上传 8 张参考图');d.assets.references.push(a.id)}else d.assets[slot]=a.id;
  }
  if(slot==='references')d.mode='reference';else if(d.assets.first_frame&&d.assets.last_frame)d.mode='first_last';else if(d.assets.first_frame)d.mode='first';
  toast('素材已保存到本机；提交生成时才会发送至模型');
 }catch(err){toast(err.message)}finally{uploadLocks.delete(lock);state.uploading-=list.length;if(state.page===kind)renderStudio(kind);else updateGenerate()}
}
function updateGenerate(){const b=$('#generate-button');if(b){b.disabled=!chosen(state.page)||state.busy||state.uploading>0;b.innerHTML=icon(state.page==='video'?'video':'spark')+(state.uploading?' 素材上传中…':state.page==='audio'?' 生成语音':state.page==='video'?' 生成视频':' 生成图像')}const send=$('[data-assistant-send]');if(send)send.disabled=state.busy||!chosen('chat')||state.jobs.some(j=>j.conversation_id===state.conversationId&&active(j))}
function payloadFor(kind){const d=state.drafts[kind],p=chosen(kind),caps=capabilities(p);const inputs={references:d.mode==='reference'?d.assets.references:[],first_frame:['first','first_last'].includes(d.mode)?d.assets.first_frame:null,last_frame:d.mode==='first_last'?d.assets.last_frame:null};if(d.mode==='reference'&&!inputs.references.length)throw Error('请先上传至少一张参考图');if(['first','first_last'].includes(d.mode)&&!inputs.first_frame)throw Error('请先上传首帧图片');if(d.mode==='first_last'&&!inputs.last_frame)throw Error('请先上传尾帧图片');const parameters=Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(d.parameters).filter(([k,v])=>v!==''&&v!=null&&caps[k==='n'?'batch':k]));return {provider_id:p?.id,prompt:d.prompt,size:d.size||'auto',seconds:d.seconds,input_assets:inputs,parameters}}
async function submitGeneration(e){e.preventDefault();if(state.busy||state.uploading)return;const kind=state.page;try{const payload=payloadFor(kind);state.busy=true;updateGenerate();const j=await api('/api/jobs',payload);state.jobs.unshift(j);state.currentJob[kind]=j.id;if(state.page===kind)updateResult(true);toast('任务已提交，生成状态会自动更新')}catch(err){toast(err.message)}finally{state.busy=false;updateGenerate()}}
function formatMessage(text){return String(text).split(/(```[\s\S]*?```)/g).map(part=>part.startsWith('```')?`<pre><code>${esc(part.replace(/^```[^\n]*\n?/,'').replace(/```$/,''))}</code></pre>`:esc(part).replace(/\*\*([^*\n]+)\*\*/g,'<strong>$1</strong>').replace(/`([^`\n]+)`/g,'<code>$1</code>')).join('')}
const assistantStarters=[['assistant','润色创作提示词','请帮我润色创作提示词，输出一段可直接使用的描述。'],['video','拆解视频分镜','请帮我将创意拆成镜头，分别说明画面、运动和节奏。'],['sliders','解释生成参数','请解释首帧、尾帧、种子和参考强度如何影响生成结果。'],['info','排查接口问题','我遇到了模型调用问题，请引导我检查协议、模型和参数。']];
function contextFromStudio(){const kind=['image','video'].includes(state.page)?state.page:state.assistantOrigin;const d=state.drafts[kind],p=chosen(kind);state.assistantOrigin=kind;return {page:names[kind],kind,prompt:d.prompt,model:p?.model||'',parameters:{...d.parameters,size:d.size,seconds:p?.mapped_controls?.seconds===false?null:d.seconds}}}
function assistantMarkup(drawer=false){return `<div class="assistant-area ${drawer?'':'panel'}">${drawer?`<div class="dialog-head"><h2 id="assistant-title">网页 AI 助手</h2><div><button class="icon-button" data-page="assistant" title="在完整页面打开" aria-label="在完整页面打开">${icon('expand')}</button><button class="icon-button" data-action="close-assistant" aria-label="关闭助手">${icon('close')}</button></div></div>`:''}<div class="assistant-toolbar"><div class="assistant-orb">${icon('assistant')}</div><div><h2>光屿创作助手</h2><small>${chosen('chat')?'使用你的语言模型':'接入语言模型后开始'}</small></div><label class="sr-only" for="assistant-model">助手模型</label><select id="assistant-model">${options('chat')}</select></div><div class="messages" id="assistant-messages"></div><form class="assistant-compose" id="assistant-form">${state.assistantContext?`<label class="context-toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="attach-context" ${state.attachContext?'checked':''}>附带${esc(state.assistantContext.page)}的当前草稿</label><div class="context-card" id="context-card" ${state.attachContext?'':'hidden'}>${icon(state.assistantContext.kind)} ${esc(state.assistantContext.prompt||'尚未填写描述')} · ${esc(state.assistantContext.model||'未选择模型')}</div>`:'<p class="field-hint assistant-privacy">从工作台打开助手，可主动附带当前创作草稿。</p>'}<label class="sr-only" for="assistant-input">向网页 AI 助手提问</label><textarea id="assistant-input" maxlength="32000" placeholder="描述你的想法，或向我询问网页用法…" required>${esc(state.assistantDraft)}</textarea><div class="compose-footer"><small>Ctrl / ⌘ + Enter 发送 · 最近 40 条上下文</small><button type="submit" class="button primary" data-assistant-send ${!chosen('chat')||state.busy?'disabled':''}>发送 ${icon('send')}</button></div>${!chosen('chat')?'<p class="field-hint"><button type="button" class="text-button" data-add-kind="chat">接入语言模型 →</button></p>':''}</form></div>`}
function renderAssistantPage(){closeAssistant();if(chosen('chat'))state.selected.chat=chosen('chat').id;$('#page').innerHTML=heading('网页 AI 助手','从提示词到参数，让助手参与创作的每一步。',`<button class="button secondary" data-action="new-conversation">${icon('plus')} 新对话</button>`)+`<div class="assistant-page"><aside class="panel conversation-panel"><button class="button secondary wide" data-action="new-conversation">${icon('plus')} 新建对话</button><div class="conversation-label">最近会话</div>${state.conversations.map(c=>`<button class="conversation ${c.id===state.conversationId?'active':''}" data-conversation="${c.id}" title="${esc(c.title)}">${esc(c.title)}</button>`).join('')}</aside>${assistantMarkup()}</div>`;bindAssistant();renderMessages(true)}
function openAssistant(polish=false){if(state.page==='assistant'){if(polish){state.assistantDraft=assistantStarters[0][2];renderAssistantPage()}return}state.assistantContext=contextFromStudio();state.attachContext=polish;state.assistantDraft=polish?'请优化我附带的创作描述，保留原始意图、加强构图和光影细节，只输出可直接使用的提示词。':state.assistantDraft;const dlg=$('#assistant-dialog');dlg.innerHTML=assistantMarkup(true);if(!dlg.open)dlg.showModal();renderNavigation();bindAssistant();renderMessages(true);$('#assistant-input').focus()}
function closeAssistant(){const dlg=$('#assistant-dialog');if(dlg.open)dlg.close();dlg.innerHTML='';if($('#assistant-fab'))$('#assistant-fab').hidden=state.page==='assistant'}
function bindAssistant(){$('#assistant-model').onchange=e=>{state.selected.chat=e.target.value;updateGenerate()};$('#assistant-input').oninput=e=>state.assistantDraft=e.target.value;$('#assistant-input').onkeydown=e=>{if(e.key==='Enter'&&(e.ctrlKey||e.metaKey)){e.preventDefault();$('#assistant-form').requestSubmit()}};$('#assistant-form').onsubmit=sendAssistant;const box=$('#attach-context');if(box)box.onchange=()=>{state.attachContext=box.checked;$('#context-card').hidden=!box.checked};assistantSignature='';updateGenerate()}
function renderMessages(force=false){const root=$('#assistant-messages');if(!root)return;const c=state.conversations.find(x=>x.id===state.conversationId);const job=state.jobs.find(j=>j.conversation_id===state.conversationId);const signature=JSON.stringify([c,job?.status,job?.error]);if(!force&&signature===assistantSignature)return;assistantSignature=signature;const nearBottom=root.scrollHeight-root.scrollTop-root.clientHeight<70;root.innerHTML=c?.messages.length?c.messages.map((m,i)=>`<article class="message ${m.role}"><div class="message-role">${m.role==='user'?'你':icon('assistant')+' 网页 AI 助手'}</div><div class="message-text">${formatMessage(m.content)}</div>${m.role==='assistant'?`<div class="message-actions"><button data-copy-message="${i}">${icon('copy')} 复制</button><button data-adopt="image" data-message="${i}">用于图像提示词</button><button data-adopt="video" data-message="${i}">用于视频描述</button></div>`:''}</article>`).join(''):`<div class="assistant-welcome"><div class="assistant-orb">${icon('assistant')}</div><h3>把想法，变成更好的创作。</h3><p>我可以协助你润色描述、设计镜头、解释模型参数。<br>你决定何时采用建议，何时开始生成。</p><div class="assistant-starters">${assistantStarters.map(([ic,title],i)=>`<button data-starter="${i}">${icon(ic)}${title}</button>`).join('')}</div></div>`;if(job&&active(job))root.innerHTML+='<div class="notice"><span class="spinner"></span> 正在整理回答…</div>';else if(job&&job.status!=='succeeded')root.innerHTML+=`<div class="notice error">${esc(job.error)}</div>`;if(force||nearBottom)root.scrollTop=c?.messages.length?root.scrollHeight:0;updateGenerate()}
async function sendAssistant(e){
 e.preventDefault();if(state.busy||$('[data-assistant-send]').disabled)return;
 const p=chosen('chat'),convBefore=state.conversationId,versionBefore=conversationVersion,draftBefore=state.assistantDraft;
 state.busy=true;updateGenerate();
 try{
  const payload={provider_id:p.id,prompt:draftBefore,conversation_id:convBefore};
  if(state.attachContext&&state.assistantContext)payload.assistant_context=state.assistantContext;
  const j=await api('/api/jobs',payload);state.jobs.unshift(j);
  if(conversationVersion===versionBefore&&state.conversationId===convBefore){
   state.conversationId=j.conversation_id;
   if(state.assistantDraft===draftBefore){state.assistantDraft='';if($('#assistant-input'))$('#assistant-input').value=''}
  }
  state.conversations=(await api('/api/conversations')).conversations;
  if(state.page==='assistant')renderAssistantPage();else renderMessages(true);
 }catch(err){toast(err.message)}finally{state.busy=false;updateGenerate()}
}
function metric(title,value,note,ic){return `<div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">${title}${icon(ic)}</div><strong>${count(value)}</strong><small>${note}</small></div>`}
function chartHTML(report){const daily=report.daily.slice(-30);if(!daily.some(d=>d.usage_reported_requests>0))return '<div class="chart-empty">模型返回用量后，这里将显示每日 Token 趋势</div>';const max=Math.max(1,...daily.flatMap(x=>[x.input_tokens||0,x.output_tokens||0]));const width=720,height=170,gap=width/Math.max(1,daily.length);return `<svg class="usage-svg" viewBox="0 0 ${width} ${height}" role="img" aria-label="每日输入和输出 Token"><path d="M0 30H720M0 70H720M0 110H720M0 145H720" stroke="#eef1f7" fill="none"/>${daily.map((d,i)=>{const w=Math.min(18,gap*.28),x=i*gap+gap/2,hin=(d.input_tokens||0)/max*120,hout=(d.output_tokens||0)/max*120;return `<g><title>${esc(d.date)}：输入 ${count(d.input_tokens)} / 输出 ${count(d.output_tokens)}</title><rect x="${x-w-1}" y="${145-hin}" width="${w}" height="${hin}" rx="2" fill="#7f8cdc"/><rect x="${x+1}" y="${145-hout}" width="${w}" height="${hout}" rx="2" fill="#c1caf3"/>${daily.length<=10||i%Math.ceil(daily.length/8)===0?`<text x="${x}" y="164" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a3aec0" font-size="9">${esc(d.date.slice(5))}</text>`:''}</g>`}).join('')}</svg>`}
function renderUsage(){const r=state.usage;$('#page').innerHTML=heading('模型与用量','看清每个接入模型，以及这台电脑记录的每次调用。',`<a class="button secondary" href="/api/usage.csv?period=${state.period}" download>${icon('download')} 导出 CSV</a>`)+`<div class="list-toolbar"><div class="segmented" aria-label="统计时间范围">${[['today','今天'],['7d','7 天'],['30d','30 天'],['all','全部']].map(([k,v])=>`<button data-period="${k}" class="${state.period===k?'active':''}">${v}</button>`).join('')}</div><button class="text-button" data-action="refresh-usage">${icon('refresh')} ${state.usageLoading?'刷新中':'刷新数据'}</button></div><div class="usage-intro">${icon('info')}<span>仅统计本工作台的 API 返回用量。未提供 Token 的请求显示 —；缓存和推理属于子集，不重复累计。</span></div><div id="usage-content">${state.usageError?`<div class="notice error">${esc(state.usageError)}</div>`:r?usageContents(r):'<div class="boot-state">正在读取模型与用量…</div>'}</div>`}
function usageContents(r){const s=r.summary;return `<div class="metric-grid">${metric('已记录 Token',s.total_tokens,`${s.token_complete_requests} 次总量可用 · ${s.token_incomplete_requests} 次总量不完整 / 未提供`,'usage')}${metric('输入 Token',s.input_tokens,`缓存输入 ${count(s.cached_input_tokens)} · 已含在输入中`,'arrow')}${metric('输出 Token',s.output_tokens,`推理输出 ${count(s.reasoning_tokens)} · 已含在输出中`,'assistant')}${metric('模型调用',s.requests,`成功 ${s.succeeded} · 失败 ${s.failed} · 进行中 ${s.active}`,'model')}</div><section class="panel usage-chart"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>用量趋势 <span class="micro">· 北京时间${r.daily.length>30?' · 仅显示最近 30 天':''}</span></h2><div class="chart-legend"><span><i class="legend-dot"></i>输入</span><span><i class="legend-dot output"></i>输出</span></div></div>${chartHTML(r)}<div class="canvas-info"><span>完成图像 ${s.image_count} 张 · 视频 ${s.video_count} 个 · 音频 ${s.audio_count||0} 段</span><span>平均耗时 ${elapsed(s.avg_latency_ms)}</span></div></section><section class="panel table-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>接入模型 <span class="micro">${s.connected_models} 个当前连接${s.historical_models?' · '+s.historical_models+' 个历史版本':''}</span></h2><button class="text-button" data-page="settings">管理连接 ${icon('arrow')}</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>模型 / 连接</th><th>用途与协议</th><th>调用次数</th><th>输入 Token</th><th>输出 Token</th><th>总 Token</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody>${r.models.length?r.models.map(m=>`<tr><td><div class="table-model"><div class="table-model-icon">${icon(m.kind==='chat'?'assistant':m.kind)}</div><div><strong>${esc(m.model)}</strong><small>${esc(m.provider_name)}</small></div></div></td><td>${kindNames[m.kind]||esc(m.kind)}<small>${esc(protocolNames[m.protocol]||m.protocol)}</small></td><td>${m.requests}<small>成功 ${m.succeeded} · 失败 ${m.failed}</small></td><td>${count(m.input_tokens)}</td><td>${count(m.output_tokens)}</td><td>${count(m.total_tokens)}<small>${m.token_incomplete_requests?m.token_incomplete_requests+' 次总量不完整 / 未提供':''}</small></td><td><span class="${m.connected?'connected-tag':'historical-tag'}">${m.connected?'已接入':'历史连接'}</span></td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan="7" class="table-empty">尚未接入模型。添加 API 连接后会自动显示在这里。</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div></section><section class="panel table-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>请求明细</h2><span class="micro">最近 ${r.requests.length} 条 · CSV 可导出全部</span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>时间</th><th>模型</th><th>用途</th><th>状态</th><th>Token</th><th>耗时</th></tr></thead><tbody>${r.requests.length?r.requests.map(j=>`<tr><td>${timeLabel(j.created_at)}</td><td><strong>${esc(j.model)}</strong><small>${esc(j.provider_name)}</small></td><td>${kindNames[j.kind]}</td><td>${badge(j)}</td><td>${count(j.total_tokens)}<small>${j.total_tokens==null?'平台未提供':''}</small></td><td>${elapsed(j.elapsed_ms)}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td class="table-empty" colspan="6">这个时间范围内还没有调用记录</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div></section><p class="usage-footnote">统计来自本机保存的接口响应，不能代表平台账户余额或完整账单。图像和视频可能按张数、秒数计费；未报告的 Token 不按 0 处理，汇总仅累加已知部分；总量不完整的请求不代表 0 消耗。历史记录没有返回用量的部分无法追溯补齐。</p>`}
async function refreshUsage(){const revision=++usageVersion;state.usageLoading=true;state.usageError='';try{const r=await api('/api/usage?period='+state.period);if(revision!==usageVersion)return;state.usage=r}catch(err){if(revision===usageVersion)state.usageError=err.message}finally{if(revision===usageVersion){state.usageLoading=false;if(state.page==='usage')renderUsage()}}}
function fieldHTML(name,label,value='',options={}){const {type='text',placeholder='',required=false}=options;return `<label>${label}<input name="${name}" type="${type}" value="${esc(value)}" placeholder="${esc(placeholder)}" ${required?'required':''} ${type==='password'?'autocomplete="new-password"':''}></label>`}
function renderHistory(){const works=libraryWorks();if(!['all','saved','unsaved','image','video','audio'].includes(state.filter))state.filter='all';const job=works.find(j=>j.id===state.detail);if(job){$('#page').innerHTML=heading('创作详情',`${esc(job.provider_name)} · ${timeLabel(job.created_at)}`,`<button class="button secondary" data-action="back-history">返回记录</button>`)+`<div class="detail-layout"><section class="canvas-panel">${job.kind==='chat'?`<div class="message-text">${formatMessage(job.result?.text||job.error||statusNames[job.status])}</div>`:resultHTML(job)}<div class="detail-prompt">${esc(job.prompt)}</div></section><aside class="panel detail-inspector"><h3>任务信息</h3><dl><dt>模型</dt><dd>${esc(job.response_model||job.model)}</dd><dt>状态</dt><dd>${badge(job)}</dd><dt>耗时 / Token</dt><dd>${elapsed(job.elapsed_ms)} · ${count((job.usage||job.result?.usage)?.total_tokens)}</dd><dt>平台任务 ID</dt><dd>${esc(job.upstream_id||'—')}</dd><dt>高级参数</dt><dd>${esc(JSON.stringify(job.parameters||{}))}</dd><dt>输入素材</dt><dd>${job.input_assets?.references?.length||0} 张参考图${job.input_assets?.first_frame?' · 首帧':''}${job.input_assets?.last_frame?' · 尾帧':''}</dd></dl><button class="button secondary wide reuse-button" data-reuse="${job.id}">${icon('copy')} 复用创作设置</button></aside></div>`;return}state.detail=null;const list=works.filter(j=>state.filter==='all'||j.kind===state.filter||(state.filter==='saved'&&j.archive_status==='saved')||(state.filter==='unsaved'&&j.result?.assets?.some(a=>!a.local)));$('#page').innerHTML=heading('作品库','收纳生成成功的图片、视频和音频，自动保存到本机，随时查看与下载。')+librarySummary()+`<div class="list-toolbar"><div class="segmented">${[['all','全部'],['saved','已保存'],['unsaved','待保存'],['image','图像'],['video','视频'],['audio','音频']].map(([k,t])=>`<button data-history-filter="${k}" class="${state.filter===k?'active':''}">${t}</button>`).join('')}</div><span class="micro">显示 ${list.length} / ${works.length} 项作品</span></div><div class="history-grid">${list.map(j=>{const a=j.result?.assets?.[0];return `<article class="panel history-card"><button class="history-preview wide" data-detail="${j.id}" aria-label="查看创作 ${esc(j.prompt.slice(0,30))}">${a?.type==='image'&&!a.save_error?`<img src="${esc(a.url)}" alt="${esc(j.prompt.slice(0,60))}" loading="lazy">`:icon(j.kind==='chat'?'assistant':j.kind)}${badge(j)}</button><div class="history-card-body">${archiveLabel(j)}<h3 title="${esc(j.prompt)}">${esc(j.prompt)}</h3><div class="history-card-meta"><span>${esc(j.model)}</span><span>${timeLabel(j.created_at)}</span></div><button class="button secondary" data-detail="${j.id}">查看详情 ${icon('arrow')}</button></div></article>`}).join('')}</div>${!list.length?`<section class="panel">${empty('history','暂无符合条件的作品','生成成功的图片、视频和音频会显示在这里。')}</section>`:''}`}
async function reuseJob(id){const j=state.jobs.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!j)return;if(j.kind==='chat'){conversationVersion++;state.assistantDraft=j.prompt;go('assistant');return}const d=state.drafts[j.kind];d.prompt=j.prompt;d.size=j.size;d.seconds=j.seconds;d.parameters={...(j.parameters||{})};d.assets={references:[],first_frame:null,last_frame:null,...j.input_assets};const ids=[...d.assets.references,d.assets.first_frame,d.assets.last_frame].filter(Boolean);try{for(const identity of ids){if(!state.assets[identity])state.assets[identity]=await api('/api/uploads/'+identity)}}catch{toast('部分素材不可用，已保留提示词和参数');d.assets={references:[],first_frame:null,last_frame:null}}d.mode=d.assets.last_frame&&d.assets.first_frame?'first_last':d.assets.first_frame?'first':d.assets.references.length?'reference':'text';state.selected[j.kind]=j.provider_id;go(j.kind)}
function previewAsset(a,title='作品预览'){if(!a)return toast('生成完成后可放大预览');const dlg=$('#asset-dialog');dlg.innerHTML=`<div class="dialog-head"><h2>${esc(title)}</h2><button class="icon-button" data-action="close-asset" aria-label="关闭大图">${icon('close')}</button></div>${a.type==='audio'?`<div class="audio-result">${icon('audio')}<strong>AI 生成语音</strong><audio src="${esc(a.url)}" controls preload="metadata"></audio></div>`:a.type==='video'?`<video src="${esc(a.url)}" controls playsinline></video>`:`<img src="${esc(a.url)}" alt="${esc(title)}">`}`;dlg.showModal()}
function confirmAction(title,text){return new Promise(resolve=>{const dlg=$('#confirm-dialog');dlg.innerHTML=`<div class="dialog-head"><h2 id="confirm-title">${esc(title)}</h2></div><div class="dialog-content">${esc(text)}</div><div class="dialog-footer"><button class="button secondary" id="confirm-cancel">取消</button><button class="button danger" id="confirm-ok">确认</button></div>`;let result=false;$('#confirm-ok').onclick=()=>{result=true;dlg.close()};$('#confirm-cancel').onclick=()=>dlg.close();dlg.addEventListener('close',()=>resolve(result),{once:true});dlg.showModal()})}
const prompts={image:['一瓶透明玻璃香水置于深色石材上，侧逆光勾勒瓶身，清晰水珠，低饱和度，高端商业产品摄影。','临海的极简美术馆，挑高空间，暖白墙面，午后阳光穿过格栅形成柔和阴影，建筑摄影，留白构图。','雨后的城市街道，路灯倒映在积水里，撑伞的背影走向远处，电影质感，蓝金色调，浅景深。'],video:['夜色街道里，一个行人缓慢经过橱窗，镜头平稳跟随，霓虹灯映入积水，细腻的电影光影，克制的节奏。','一只银色耳机置于深色背景，镜头缓慢环绕，柔和边缘光勾勒金属细节，干净的产品广告镜头。','清晨松林笼罩薄雾，阳光穿过树冠，镜头缓慢向前推进，叶片随风轻动，自然纪录片质感。']};
document.addEventListener('click',async e=>{const el=e.target.closest('button,[data-preview-upload],[data-expand-job]');if(!el)return;
 if(el.dataset.copyMaterial){const item=materialCatalog.find(x=>x.id===el.dataset.copyMaterial);if(!item)return;try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(item.url);toast('素材链接已复制')}catch{toast('无法访问剪贴板，可右键“查看素材与提示词”复制链接')}return}
 if(el.dataset.page)return go(el.dataset.page);
 if(el.dataset.mode){state.drafts[state.page].mode=el.dataset.mode;return renderStudio(state.page)}
 if(el.dataset.size){state.drafts[state.page].size=el.dataset.size;$('#size-input').value=el.dataset.size;document.querySelectorAll('[data-size]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b===el));return}
 if(el.dataset.param)return;
 if(el.dataset.preset!==undefined){state.drafts[state.page].prompt=prompts[state.page][Number(el.dataset.preset)];$('#prompt').value=state.drafts[state.page].prompt;$('#prompt-count').textContent=`${state.drafts[state.page].prompt.length} / 32000`;$('#prompt').focus();return}
 if(el.dataset.removeAsset){const d=state.drafts[state.page],slot=el.dataset.removeAsset;if(slot==='references')d.assets.references.splice(Number(el.dataset.index),1);else d.assets[slot]=null;return renderStudio(state.page)}
 if(el.dataset.previewUpload)return previewAsset(state.assets[el.dataset.previewUpload],'上传素材');
 if(el.dataset.expandJob)return previewAsset(currentAsset(state.jobs.find(j=>j.id===el.dataset.expandJob)));
 if(el.dataset.selectJob){state.currentJob[state.page]=el.dataset.selectJob;return updateResult(true)}
 if(el.dataset.assetIndex!==undefined){state.assetIndex[el.dataset.job]=Number(el.dataset.assetIndex);return state.page==='history'?renderHistory():updateResult(true)}
 if(el.dataset.period){state.period=el.dataset.period;state.usage=null;renderUsage();return refreshUsage()}
 if(el.dataset.historyFilter){state.filter=el.dataset.historyFilter;return renderHistory()}
 if(el.dataset.detail){state.detail=el.dataset.detail;return renderHistory()}
 if(el.dataset.reuse)return reuseJob(el.dataset.reuse);
 if(el.dataset.discoverProvider)return editProvider(el.dataset.discoverProvider,null,{autoDiscover:true});
 if(el.dataset.edit)return editProvider(el.dataset.edit);
 if(el.dataset.addKind)return editProvider(null,el.dataset.addKind);
 if(el.dataset.conversation){conversationVersion++;state.conversationId=el.dataset.conversation;return renderAssistantPage()}
 if(el.dataset.starter!==undefined){state.assistantDraft=assistantStarters[Number(el.dataset.starter)][2];$('#assistant-input').value=state.assistantDraft;$('#assistant-input').focus();return}
 if(el.dataset.copyMessage!==undefined){const c=state.conversations.find(x=>x.id===state.conversationId);try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(c.messages[Number(el.dataset.copyMessage)].content);toast('已复制回答')}catch{toast('无法访问剪贴板，请选中文字复制')}return}
 if(el.dataset.adopt){const c=state.conversations.find(x=>x.id===state.conversationId);const text=c.messages[Number(el.dataset.message)].content,kind=el.dataset.adopt;if(state.drafts[kind].prompt&&!await confirmAction('替换当前创作描述？','已有草稿将被这段助手回答替换，尚未提交生成。'))return;state.drafts[kind].prompt=text;go(kind);toast('已采用到创作描述，确认参数后可自行生成');return}
 if(el.dataset.archive){el.disabled=true;try{const j=await api('/api/jobs/archive',{id:el.dataset.archive});state.jobs=state.jobs.map(x=>x.id===j.id?j:x);state.page==='history'?renderHistory():updateResult(true);toast('正在保存原作品，不会重新提交生成')}catch(err){toast(err.message);el.disabled=false}return}
 if(el.dataset.resume){el.disabled=true;try{const j=await api('/api/jobs/resume',{id:el.dataset.resume});state.jobs=state.jobs.map(x=>x.id===j.id?j:x);state.page==='history'?renderHistory():updateResult(true);toast('继续查询原任务，不会重新提交生成')}catch(err){toast(err.message);el.disabled=false}return}
 if(el.dataset.check){el.disabled=true;try{const r=await api('/api/providers/check',{id:el.dataset.check});const p=state.providers.find(x=>x.id===el.dataset.check);toast(`模型列表可访问，返回 ${r.models.length} 项。${r.models.includes(p.model)||r.models.includes('models/'+p.model)?'已找到当前模型。':'未在列表中找到当前模型。'}生成能力仍需实际验证。`)}catch(err){toast(err.message)}finally{el.disabled=false}return}
 if(el.dataset.delete){const p=state.providers.find(x=>x.id===el.dataset.delete);if(!await confirmAction('删除模型连接？',`删除“${p.name}”的连接设置。已有创作记录和用量历史会保留。`))return;try{await api('/api/providers/delete',{id:p.id});state.providers=state.providers.filter(x=>x.id!==p.id);state.usage=null;render();toast('连接已删除，历史记录已保留')}catch(err){toast(err.message)}return}
 const action=el.dataset.action;
 if(action==='add-provider')return editProvider();
 if(action==='close-provider')return closeProvider();
 if(action==='open-assistant')return openAssistant();
 if(action==='polish')return openAssistant(true);
 if(action==='close-assistant')return closeAssistant();
 if(action==='expand-result')return previewAsset(currentAsset(currentJob(state.page)));
 if(action==='close-asset')return $('#asset-dialog').close();
 if(action==='refresh-usage')return refreshUsage();
 if(action==='back-history'){state.detail=null;return renderHistory()}
 if(action==='new-conversation'){conversationVersion++;state.conversationId=null;state.assistantDraft='';return renderAssistantPage()}
});
$('#assistant-dialog').addEventListener('close',()=>{$('#assistant-dialog').innerHTML='';$('#assistant-fab').hidden=state.page==='assistant'});
$('#provider-dialog').addEventListener('close',()=>{const input=$('#provider-form [name=api_key]');if(input)input.value=''});
$('#asset-dialog').addEventListener('close',()=>$('#asset-dialog').innerHTML='');
window.addEventListener('hashchange',()=>{state.detail=null;render()});
async function pollJobs(){if(polling||!state.jobs.some(j=>active(j)||j.archive_status==='pending'))return;polling=true;try{const jobs=(await api('/api/jobs')).jobs;const changed=JSON.stringify(jobs)!==JSON.stringify(state.jobs);const chatChanged=JSON.stringify(jobs.filter(j=>j.kind==='chat'))!==JSON.stringify(state.jobs.filter(j=>j.kind==='chat'));if(chatChanged)state.conversations=(await api('/api/conversations')).conversations;state.jobs=jobs;if(changed){state.usage=null;if(['image','video','audio'].includes(state.page))updateResult();else if(state.page==='history')renderHistory();else if(state.page==='usage')refreshUsage();renderMessages();updateGenerate()}}catch{toast('暂时无法连接本机服务，任务记录仍保存在电脑上。')}finally{polling=false}}
async function init(){try{Object.assign(state,await api('/api/bootstrap'));render();setInterval(pollJobs,2500)}catch(err){$('#page').innerHTML=empty('info','无法读取本机工作区',esc(err.message),'<button class="button primary" id="retry-bootstrap">重新连接</button>');$('#retry-bootstrap').onclick=()=>location.reload()}}
init();
